{"4205020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Aurora Zen", "steam_appid": 4205020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paint the sky with vibrant Auroras. Relax and find your zen by filling the sky with brilliant ribbons of beautiful colour and shapes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find your Zen</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From mountain tops, to desert landscapes, Immerse yourself in calming and beautiful landscapes on both desktop and in VR. Use your mouse, VR controllers or tracked Hands to paint beautiful Aurora's across the night sky. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control The Environment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cycle through different colours or strength of Auroras. You have the controls at your finger tips to fill the sky above you. Jump between environments, from calming mountain lakes from a passing train, to Viking hilltops.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive VR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become fully immersed of the wonder and awe of the Aurora's through VR. Using controllers or tracked hands, connect yourself to the cosmos by painting your own Aurora's across the sky or light up the surroundings through bioluminescent water.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paint the sky with vibrant Auroras. Relax and find your zen by filling the sky with brilliant ribbons of beautiful colour and shapes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find your Zen</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From mountain tops, to desert landscapes, Immerse yourself in calming and beautiful landscapes on both desktop and in VR. Use your mouse, VR controllers or tracked Hands to paint beautiful Aurora's across the night sky. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control The Environment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cycle through different colours or strength of Auroras. You have the controls at your finger tips to fill the sky above you. Jump between environments, from calming mountain lakes from a passing train, to Viking hilltops.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive VR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become fully immersed of the wonder and awe of the Aurora's through VR. Using controllers or tracked hands, connect yourself to the cosmos by painting your own Aurora's across the sky or light up the surroundings through bioluminescent water.</p>", "short_description": "Paint the sky with vibrant aurora. Relax and find your zen by filling the sky with brilliant ribbons of beautiful colour and shapes.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205020/2ec748906465bc67134edfc1a24dd62c7f5dac0c/header.jpg?t=1779762984", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205020/e71eb5124de466d51783e8762b143f25b250e954/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779762984", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205020/e71eb5124de466d51783e8762b143f25b250e954/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779762984", "website": "http://aurorazen.app/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NIVIDIA 3060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Quest 2</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NIVIDIA 4070<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</s